gain and carried over.",[337,344,345,346,349,350,353],{},"An empty side counts as 0; when both are empty, all three bindings are ",[291,347,348],{},"null",". Strings, negative numbers, decimals, ",[291,351,352],{},"NaN"," or values beyond the safe integer range from the parent count as empty.",[315,355,357],{"id":356},"narrow-containers","Narrow containers",[288,359,360],{},"When the container is too narrow for both the years and months inputs, it switches to a single \"total months\" input; with enough width it goes back to both inputs, keeping any input not yet committed.",[330,362],{"name":363},"months-compact",[315,365,367],{"id":366},"variants","Variants",[288,369,370,371,298,374,377,378,381],{},"Uses the ",[291,372,373],{},"color",[291,375,376],{},"highlight"," of ",[291,379,380],{},"UInput",", applied to every input.",[330,383],{"name":384},"months-color",[315,386,388],{"id":387},"size-and-states","Size and states",[288,390,391,392,395],{},"While loading, a spinner shows after the months unit and input is disabled. The year and month units switch with the locale (\"yr\" and \"mo\" in English, \"年\" and \"月\" in Traditional Chinese); their width follows the text, and so does the width needed for the full years and months layout. See ",[304,393,102],{"href":394},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[330,397],{"name":398},"months-states",[310,400,402],{"id":401},"examples","Examples",[315,404,406],{"id":405},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[288,408,409,410,413,414,298,417,420],{},"Bind the total months, use ",[291,411,412],{},"requiredNumber"," for a required field, and check bounds separately with ",[291,415,416],{},"v.minValue",[291,418,419],{},"v.maxValue",".",[330,422],{"name":423},"months-validation",[315,425,427],{"id":426},"binding-only-years-and-months","Binding only years and months",[288,429,430,431,298,433,420],{},"When the API splits seniority into year and month fields, bind only ",[291